# FinFam Recruitment Portal — environment template.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (`cp .env.example .env`) and adjust the values.
# `.env` is git-ignored and never committed; this template is.
#
# Every wrapper script (scripts/dev.sh, scripts/prisma.sh, scripts/test.sh)
# sources `.env` with `set -a`, so its values take precedence over any
# inherited shell environment.

# ── Database (required) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Prisma connection string. The local stack uses the bundled PostgreSQL
# started by `bun run db:start` (bound to 127.0.0.1 only, no root needed).
# Format: postgresql://<user>[@<host>:<port>]/<database>
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres@127.0.0.1:5432/finfam

# ── Local Postgres overrides (optional — defaults shown) ───────────────
# Used by scripts/postgres.sh + scripts/ensure-db.ts when booting the
# bundled PostgreSQL binaries. The DATABASE_URL above must match these.
# FINFAM_DB_NAME=finfam
# FINFAM_DB_USER=postgres
# FINFAM_DB_PORT=5432

# ── Flow test suite override (optional) ────────────────────────────────
# `bun run test` drives the REAL dev server over HTTP. Override only when
# testing against a different running instance (defaults to port 3000).
# FLOW_TEST_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000
